u can get that pick up  that wireless charging signal now one of  the main concerns with using wireless  products and games is if you're going to  get any lag or latency i played  counter-strike global offensive all week  but i didn't have any issues with  sniping or making sure my aim was  precise or checking corners  now i think the whole power play system  is actually pretty sweet considering  that you can charge your mice and never  have to worry about plugging it in  because what's the point of having a  wireless mouse if you have to plug it in  in the middle of a gaming session but my  main concern is that it's going to cost  you  a lot  do you use wireless mice and games tell  us why or why not in the comments we  want to hear your thoughts and if you're  not subscribed to gamespot make sure  that you are and like this video if you  found it informative you thought it was  fun if you want to see more of this  stuff thanks for watching and i'll see  you next time
 

